      "scout": {
        "name": "Scout - routine work: cheapest, fastest, smart enough",
        // 2026-10-26 (pool remap review): all three routes addressed at #low — the rung every
        // leaf on every door has wired (Flash/GLM are overpowered for this tier at any rung:
        // AA v5 Flash max II 32, GLM max II 32, Haiku #high II 30). Flash addresses the PLAN pool
        // directly so routine traffic can never reach the PAYG tail on the parent route.
        // 2026-10-26 pass 3.1: Beam joins as a direct leaf — Reflection Beam 1.0 via the
        // Command Code proxy (AA v5: II 18, TTFT 0.59s, ~385 t/s decode, :free variant).
        // The door was probe-verified live 2026-10-26 (chat completion answered), so the
        // registry's "no API access" note is stale for the proxy path. Caveats: the proxy
        // injects its own ~21k-token agent prompt per call, and the free tier's rate
